{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to Wishlist!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 different achievements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Upgrades: Unlock 15 powerful upgrades to boost Energy collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Improvements: Level up over 50 improvements to enhance upgrade efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Types of Bonuses: Utilize passive income, boosts, rewards, and multipliers during events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egg Collection: Gather cosmic eggs in events for bonus Energy and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Collection: Accumulate experience to unlock new features and bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planet Purchase: Unlock new planets to expand your cosmic empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Purchase: Acquire cosmic cats that provide exclusive bonuses to accelerate your Energy gains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business Purchase: Invest in interstellar businesses that deliver ongoing bonuses and scalable passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige System: Reset your progress to gain permanent prestige bonuses like global multipliers, revealing higher tiers of upgrades and challenges for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statistics: Track your progress with detailed statistics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visualizer: Monitor Energy changes with a vibrant visual counter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background Effect: Enjoy a pulsating starry background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success News: Receive random success descriptions upon reaching Energy levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level System: Reach 100 levels for bonuses and new challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background Mode: Collect E